{"id": "23098", "title": "恶魔岛的使者", "author": "小三", "category": "都市言情", "count": 17, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/23/23098.htm", "intro": "「今晚有烟花耶，去看吧？」 \r\n\r\n                        　　１０月１日，国庆，在街上听得最多的是这一句话。 \r\n\r\n                        　　由于今天是公众假期，繁忙的街道上塞满一对对蜜运中的痴男怨女，个个亲\r\n                         热地手拖着手，卿卿我我，羨煞旁人。 \r\n\r\n                        　　当然，对于我这个活了２５年但仍没有女朋友的单身汉来说，这无疑是相当\r\n                         煞风境的场面。 \r\n\r\n                        　　为什么？为什么在人人欢天喜地的日子，我要孤伶伶的渡过，为什么在人人\r\n                         享受女友温柔的一刻，我却要独个饱受寒风的吹拂？ \r\n\r\n                        　　上天真是太不和平了！", "base": "files/article/html/23/23098", "chapters": [{"title": "非礼卡", "volume": true}, {"title": "（上）", "file": "1698035.html", "available": false}, {"title": "（下）", "file": "1698036.html", "available": false}, {"title": "强暴卡", "volume": true}, {"title": "（上）第一回", "file": "1698038.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二回", "file": "1698039.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三回", "file": "1698040.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四回", "file": "1698041.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五回", "file": "1698042.html", "available": false}, {"title": "（下）第七回", "file": "1698043.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八回", "file": "1698044.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九回", "file": "1698045.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十回", "file": "1698046.html", "available": false}, {"title": "亂倫卡", "volume": true}, {"title": "（1）", "file": "1698048.html", "available": false}, {"title": "（2）", "file": "1698049.html", "available": false}, {"title": "0", "file": "1698050.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1", "file": "1698051.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结篇", "file": "1698052.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "1698053.html", "available": false}]}